%description:
Tests keepalive (RFC 9293 section 3.8.4) on an idle connection. The client
has keepalive with an idle time of 30 s. No data flows after the handshake, so
after 30 s the client sends a probe without data, SEG.SEQ = SND.UNA - 1 = 0
(the log shows the sequence number), and the server answers it with an ACK.
The answer starts a new idle time, so the next probe comes 30 s later. The
connection stays open until the close at t=70.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 80s
*.cli_app.tClose=70s
*.cli_tcp.keepAliveEnabled = true
*.cli_tcp.keepAliveIdleTime = 30s
*.cli_tcp.keepAliveInterval = 5s
*.cli_tcp.keepAliveProbeCount = 3

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[30.005 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
[30.007 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1 win 16384 
[60.009 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
[60.011 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1 win 16384 
cli_tcp: ESTABLISHED --> FIN_WAIT_1  (on CLOSE)
[70.001 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A F ack 501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: ESTABLISHED --> CLOSE_WAIT  (on RCV_FIN)
[70.003 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Sending keepalive probe, seq=0
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
